  "contracts": [
    "Only distinct model IDs in a batch; all model NativeValues and Strings remain owned on the worker until every task joins",
    "SDK AIModel and InferenceFunction are Sendable and loadFunction is nonmutating synchronous throws",
    "Each native SwiftTask calls a sync adapter, not an async descriptor for loadFunction",
    "Sync error returns owned in x21, is stored separately, and is released exactly once; outer Void task completes with x20=0",
    "Callback accesses stable native memory and synchronized completion only, never session maps/Rc or NativeValue owners",
    "PreparedBatch joins ALL started operations before any result/error/native owner destruction",
    "All function descriptors and IDs validate before insertion; result Functions retain same-session Model Arcs"
  ],
